Definitions
Computer
An electronic device that processes and stores information.
Purpose:
•	Perform calculations
•	Store data
•	Execute software
Examples:
•	Desktop
•	Laptop
•	Smartphone
•	Raspberry Pi
•	Server
________________________________________
Network
A collection of devices connected together so they can exchange information.
Key Characteristics:
•	Communication
•	Resource sharing
•	Data transfer
•	Collaboration
________________________________________
Node
Any device connected to a network.
Examples:
•	Laptop
•	Smartphone
•	Printer
•	Server
•	Router
•	Security camera
________________________________________
Data
Information sent between devices.
Examples:
•	Emails
•	Videos
•	Documents
•	Photos
•	Voice calls
•	Passwords
