Types of Networks
Type	Description	                  Example
PAN	Personal Area Network	      Bluetooth earbuds
LAN	Local Area Network	      Home Wi-Fi
WLAN	Wireless Local Area Network	Coffee shop Wi-Fi
MAN	Metropolitan Area Network	City-wide network
WAN	Wide Area Network	Internet
________________________________________
Network Devices
Router
Connects different networks together.
Example:
Your home router connects your home network to your Internet Service Provider.
________________________________________
Switch
Connects devices inside the same local network.
Usually found in offices.
________________________________________
Access Point
Provides wireless connectivity.
Many modern home routers include a built-in access point.
________________________________________
Server
A computer that provides services to other computers.
Examples:
•	Web server
•	Email server
•	File server
•	Game server
________________________________________
Client
A device that requests services.
Examples:
•	Laptop
•	Phone
•	Tablet
________________________________________
Analogy
Imagine a city.
•	Houses = Computers
•	Roads = Network cables/Wi-Fi
•	Post Office = Router
•	Letters = Data packets
•	Citizens = Users
Without roads, no one can communicate.
Without networks, computers cannot exchange information.
